<section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><div class="eyebrow">ABOUT GEST</div><h1>Confidence in English proficiency</h1><p>Assess · Achieve · Connect</p></div></section><section class="container section prose"><h2>What is GEST?</h2><p>GEST – Global English Skills Test is a four-skill English proficiency assessment administered at approved test centres. It reports Listening, Reading, Writing and Speaking scores on a 0–100 scale alongside a CEFR alignment.</p><p>GEST is designed to give candidates and receiving organisations a clear report of demonstrated English skills. Results are available only after centre submission and headquarters approval, and certificates can be checked through our secure verification portal.</p><h2>Our approach</h2><div class="card-grid three"><div class="feature-card"><h3>Assess</h3><p>Consistent assessment across four language skills.</p></div><div class="feature-card"><h3>Achieve</h3><p>Clear performance reporting to support your next step.</p></div><div class="feature-card"><h3>Connect</h3><p>Secure online verification for organisations reviewing certificates.</p></div></div><p><strong>Important:</strong> Receiving organisations make their own admission or recognition decisions. GEST does not claim automatic equivalence to other English proficiency examinations.</p></section>
